OL,3,ABlack metal mourns pioneering Venom
OL,4,Afrontman
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe co-founder, frontman and bass
OL,7,Fplayer of pioneering heavy metal band
OL,8,FVenom has died at the age of 63, it has
OL,9,Fbeen announced.
OL,11,FFor almost 50 years Conrad Lant, known
OL,12,Fby his stage name Cronos, led the
OL,13,FNewcastle band credited with inventing
OL,14,Fthe black metal genre and cited as a
OL,15,Fmajor influence by thrash metal bands
OL,16,Fincluding Metallica, Slayer and
OL,17,FAnthrax.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,172,160,200,105,0,100
