OL,3,ABlack metal mourns pioneering Venom
OL,4,Afrontman
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a tribute, the group said Lant's
OL,7,F"voice, bass and vision were at the
OL,8,Fheart of Venom" and described their
OL,9,Fbandmate as "uncompromising, fearless
OL,10,Fand unmistakable".
OL,12,FHis son Nathan thanked the band's fans
OL,13,Fdown the decades "for all of the
OL,14,Fsupport you have given my dad over the
OL,15,Fyears, I know he really appreciated you
OL,16,Fall".
